  "modified_date_millis": 1786558591743,
  "description": "Shared message parsing pipeline for system auth events.\nInput contract: Expects the 'message' field to contain the syslog message body (syslog header has been parsed/removed).\nThis pipeline extracts structured fields from auth-related messages including SSH events, sudo commands, PAM authentication, and user/group management.",
